Version 0.03
02-10-26
         Fork for moOde 10 on Raspberry Pi OS Trixie.
         Full-width spectrum, idle clock with weekday and IP.
         Read volume, elapsed, duration and bitrate from currentsong.txt.
         Treat AirPlay/Spotify metadata with no state= line as playing.

